WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.135
-Here at "Late Night," every
night, I deliver a monologue

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:05.638
comprised of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.141
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.310
that due to my being
a straight white male

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.811
would be difficult
for me to deliver,

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.714
but we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.749
So we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:19.385
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.688
♪♪

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.822
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.524
-These are two of our writers,

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.159
Amber and Jenny, everybody.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.894
-I'm black.

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.228
-And I'm gay.

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:30.563
-And we're both women.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.331
-And I am not.

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:33.632
So, here's how this works.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:35.167
I'm gonna read
the setups to these jokes,

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.203
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.938
So here we go.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.708
Soccer star Megan Rapinoe
recently appeared

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.309
on the cover
of "Sports Illustrated"

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.612
wearing a dress
and holding a sledgehammer.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.013
-A dress and a sledgehammer,

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.582
or as lesbians call it,
"business casual."

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.451
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.452
-A black conservative
running for Congress

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:56.889
is describing himself as a
"Trump-supporting, gun-owning,

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.724
liberty-loving, pro-life,

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:00.893
politically incorrect
black man."

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.362
-Or if that's too long,

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:05.265
you can just go with
"incorrect black man."

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.136
-The new movie "Star Wars:
The Rise of Skywalker"

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.071
features a lesbian kiss.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:14.474
-And for most woman,
so does college.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.508
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.243
-Facebook has developed an app

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.080
that uses facial recognition
software to identify people.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.481
-And it really works.

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:24.984
Take it from me, Leslie Jones.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:27.220
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.254
-True story?

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.623
-True story!

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.660
Sorry, Facebook.
You tagged the wrong person.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.927
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:37.096
-The United Methodist Church
announced

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.697
they will be splitting in two,

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:41.835
and one half will now allow
same-sex marriage.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:44.304
-The other half will have
a terrible choir.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.207
Hey, Seth. What do you call
a straight choir?

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:49.442
-What?
-Off-key.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.576
-Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.012
-Hey, Seth.
What do call a white choir?

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.280
-What's that?
-Off-beat.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.850
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.385
The governor of Wisconsin
signed a bill

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.788
that allows kids to sell
Kool-Aid without a permit.

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:06.792
-But are cops still gonna hassle
black kids selling Kool-Aid?

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:08.528
[ As Kool-Aid Man ] "Oh, yeah."

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:09.729
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:12.498
-And now, Amber,
have the cops ever hassled you?

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:14.033
-[ As Kool-Aid Man ] Oh, yeah.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:16.969
-The New Jersey Devils --

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.339
The New Jersey Devils
hockey team recently hosted

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:22.642
an LGBTQ pride night.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:23.876
-"I hope they get in a fight,"

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:25.912
said the players
about the lesbians.

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:27.580
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.483
-The website Lifehacker
recently posted an article

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.018
titled, "Buy Your White Kid
a Black Doll."

00:02:33.018 --> 00:02:35.254
-Actually, the full title
of the article is,

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:37.023
"Buy Your White Kid
a Black Doll,

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.092
But Watch What They Do With It."

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.627
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.695
-Hey, Seth.
Why don't you tell one?

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.630
-Oh, gosh.
I don't think I should.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.365
-Come on, Seth. Just one.

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:48.601
-I feel like if I do one of
these, it's not gonna end well.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.635
-Aww, please.

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:50.936
-Oh, okay. I trust you.

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:52.271
You are my friends.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:54.173
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:55.641
NASA has announced

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:59.212
that it wants to put a female
astronaut on the moon by 2024

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:01.047
so she can decorate it.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.181
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.549
-How dare you!

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:07.019
-You told me it would be okay!

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:09.889
Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.991
♪♪

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:13.659
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:13.659 --> 00:03:15.895
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

